  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En andra fas av samarbetet avseende arbetarskydd i Estland. Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka den estnmiska samarbetsparterns m&#xF6;jligheter att implementera lagstiftningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project constitutes a second phase of a cooperation programme within the field of occupational safety between the Swedish Work Environment Authority and the National Labour Inspectorate of Estonia. The main objective is to strenghten Estonian ability to implement the harmonised legislation.</narrative>
